   "name": "1 \u00b7 Integrity",
   "sub": "no cheating",
   "n": 972,
   "why": "Per-trade checks on every version: the month-end day count, the FOMC and auction days and the entry and exit bars were recomputed independently; each trade was long, on one of the month's last trading days with the filter met, entered and exited at the set times; no eligible day was skipped; fills were never better than the market; nothing was held overnight. Plus 40 random versions re-run on cut-off data. 0 failed."
