   "why": "Each setting is nudged one at a time, down and up: the entry time by \u00b130 minutes, the exit time by \u00b115 minutes and the number of month-end days by \u00b11 and a stop by \u00b10.1% (\"no stop\" has nothing to nudge). At least 70% of the nudged versions must be profitable, with median Sharpe \u2265 0.5. Removed 0."
  },
